"/us/en/c/2018/guaranteeprograms": {"template":"tier2-landing-page","metadata":{"title":"Guarantee Programs","pageTitle":"Support","description":"Ask our experts about our risk-sharing programs for long-term financial investment and how we can help lift the burden off your back.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/images/PIT-thumbnail-3.png","imageAlt":null,"tags":["stryker:business-unit/acute-care"],"originallyPublished":null,"lastPublished":"2023-10-24T18:25:23.000Z","contentID":"Mkt Lit-1663 13 SEP 2018 REV A"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>1.<span> Russo, C .A ., Steiner, C . and Spector, W. (2008). Hospitalizations related to Pressure Ulcers, 2006. HCUP Statistical Brief #64. December 2008. Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality, Rockville, MD.&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.hcup-us.ahrq.gov/reports/statbriefs/sb64.pdf\">http://www.hcup-us.ahrq.gov/reports/statbriefs/sb64.pdf</a></span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>2. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the 30% HAPI Reduction contract, the Rental Reduction contract, or the iBed Wireless Fall Reduction Contract. iBed Wireless System includes iBed Radios, iBed Locators, and a Stryker server application.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>3. Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality, Rockville, MD. Nurse -driven early mobility protocols: Slide presentation. Content last reviewed January 2017. Retrieved from <a href=\"http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/quality-patient-safety/hais/tools/mvp/modules/technical/nursedr-early-mobility-protocols-slides.html\">http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/quality-patient-safety/hais/tools/mvp/modules/technical/nursedr-early-mobility-protocols-slides.html</a></p>\r\n<p>4. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the iBed Wireless Fall Reduction Contract. iBed Wireless System includes iBed Radios, iBed Locators, and a Stryker server application.</p>\r\n<p>5. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the HAPI Reduction contract. Must include advanced clinical hours. Support surfaces include Isolibrium, IsoFlex, and IsoAir.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>6. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the Rental Reduction contract.</p>\r\n<p>7. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the Stryker Fall Reduction contract.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>* Burns, E. R., Stevens, J. A., &amp; Lee, R. (2016). The direct costs of fatal and non-fatal falls among older adults—United States. Journal of Safety Research, 58, 99-103.doi:10.1016/j.jsr.2016.05.001<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>** Agency for Healthcare Research and Quality, Rockville, MD. Are we ready for this change? Last reviewed in October 2014. Retrieved from:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/systems/hospital/pressureulcertoolkit/putool1.html\">http://www.ahrq.gov/professionals/systems/hospital/pressureulcertoolkit/putool1.html</a><br>\r\n</p>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":["/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/images/learning_learning_guaranteePrograms.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/images/calculator_guaranteePrograms.jpg"]},
